{"id":361,"education_philosophy":null,"history":null,"facilities":null,"feature_summary":"敬神奉仕と国際性を育む東洋英和","feature_description":"東洋英和女学院中学部・高等部は、建学の精神「敬神奉仕」を軸に、キリスト教教育と英語を基軸にした国際教育で一人ひとりのタラントを伸ばす学校です。都心の落ち着いた環境で野外教育や礼拝も行い、学びと体験を往復しながら自立と奉仕を育てます。クラブ活動も活発で、自然の中で育つ体験が学校生活を深めます。礼拝や自然体験を通じて、人との関わりも深めやすいです。","clubs":[{"id":6633,"name":"バスケットボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.toyoeiwa.ac.jp/chu-ko/life/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":6634,"name":"バレーボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.toyoeiwa.ac.jp/chu-ko/life/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":6635,"name":"卓球部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.toyoeiwa.ac.jp/chu-ko/life/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":6636,"name":"テニス部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.toyoeiwa.ac.jp/chu-ko/life/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":6637,"name":"剣道部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.toyoeiwa.ac.jp/chu-ko/life/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":6638,"name":"ワンダーフォーゲル部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.toyoeiwa.ac.jp/chu-ko/life/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":6639,"name":"スキー部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.toyoeiwa.ac.jp/chu-ko/life/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":6640,"name":"美術部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.toyoeiwa.ac.jp/chu-ko/news/2024/05/019887.html","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":6641,"name":"ボードゲーム部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.toyoeiwa.ac.jp/chu-ko/news/2024/05/019887.html","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":6642,"name":"合唱部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.toyoeiwa.ac.jp/chu-ko/news/2024/05/019887.html","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":6643,"name":"英語劇部(EDC)","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.toyoeiwa.ac.jp/chu-ko/news/2024/05/019887.html","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":6644,"name":"天文部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.toyoeiwa.ac.jp/chu-ko/news/2024/05/019887.html","verified_at":"2026-08-07"}],"profile_sources":[{"id":1265,"attribu